Rule 1 (tensor must have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 2 (tensor shape should be valid for its dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (tensor should have valid dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 7 (tensor should have valid dimensionality)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
